WEBVTT

00:04:29.348 --> 00:04:32.518
about our concept of civilization,

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:36.272
something that leaves us
lost for words, tongue tied.

00:04:36.314 --> 00:04:39.734
When we're confronted with thousands
of years of human beings,

00:04:39.734 --> 00:04:44.322
say, practicing agriculture,
creating new technologies,

00:04:44.322 --> 00:04:46.866
but not lording it over each other

00:04:46.866 --> 00:04:49.910
or exploiting each other to the maximum.

00:04:50.703 --> 00:04:52.204
Why don't we have better words?

00:04:52.246 --> 00:04:56.917
Where is our lexicon for those long
expanses of human history

00:04:56.917 --> 00:04:59.337
in which we weren't behaving that way?